    "%1$@ cannot reach your pump while Bluetooth is off, and has not connected to it since %2$@ (%3$@). Your pump keeps delivering insulin from its own settings. Turn Bluetooth on in your phone's Settings app." : {

    },
    "%1$@ does not have permission to use Bluetooth, so it cannot reach your pump and has not connected to it since %2$@ (%3$@). Your pump keeps delivering insulin from its own settings. Allow Bluetooth for the app in your phone's Settings app." : {

    },
    "%1$@ has not connected to your pump since %2$@ (%3$@), so it cannot read from it or send it anything. Your pump keeps delivering insulin from its own settings. Keep the pump nearby and powered on — reconnection is automatic." : {

    },
    "%1$@ has not connected to your pump since %2$@ (%3$@). At that time, insulin delivery was suspended. %1$@ cannot tell whether it has been resumed since." : {

    },
    "%1$@ has not connected to your pump since %2$@ (%3$@). At that time, the pump was delivering basal at %4$@ U/hr with a planned end time of %5$@. We expect the pump to have returned to its profile basal rate of %6$@ U/hr and it will continue as programmed until reconnected." : {

    },
    "%1$@ has not connected to your pump since %2$@ (%3$@). At that time, the pump was delivering basal at a temp rate of %4$@ U/hr, and will return to the profile basal rate of %5$@ U/hr at %6$@ if not reconnected." : {

    },
    "%1$@ has not connected to your pump since %2$@ (%3$@). At that time, the pump was delivering basal at the profile basal rate of %4$@ U/hr and will continue to deliver basal as programmed until reconnected." : {

    },
    "%1$@ has not connected to your pump since %2$@ (%3$@). At that time, the pump's Control-IQ algorithm was adjusting basal delivery, and it keeps running on the pump whether or not %1$@ is connected." : {

